        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7621043?u=40e1e5b86d3ec9c56af45aba283dee4cc2fc3bf3&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updated French translation lines for macros and front matter to comply with current en-US content across various content types. In addition to simplifying certain lines that were previously too long.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Provide the French environment with the translated content necessary for users to understand the articles.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">What has been changed:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Correction of existing French lines;</li>\n<li>Addition of missing lines in French;</li>\n<li>Removal of an unsupported non-breaking space.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3457903541\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/yari/issues/13516\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/yari/pull/13516/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/yari/pull/13516\">mdn/yari#13516</a><br>\nRelated to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3425007836\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/yari/issues/13504\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/yari/pull/13504/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/yari/pull/13504\">mdn/yari#13504</a> and <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3459257641\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/translated-content/issues/29351\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/translated-content/pull/29351/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/translated-content/pull/29351\">mdn/translated-content#29351</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Thanks :)</p>",
