            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45551?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adding a new translation key and copy in preparation for webref-7 css formal specification support.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Webref 7 support</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3429957703\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/rari/issues/317\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/rari/pull/317/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/rari/pull/317\">mdn/rari#317</a></p>",
